# Privacy Policy for WR Prayer Book

**Last Updated: September 26, 2026**

WR Prayer Book is a Western-Rite Orthodox prayer application featuring prayer resources, a private confession journal, and a fasting and feast-day calendar.

## Personal Information

WR Prayer Book does not require users to create an account.

The developer does not collect the contents of users' prayers, confession journal entries, or other personal information entered into the app.

## Confession Journal

WR Prayer Book includes a confession journal for personal use and preparation for confession.

Confession journal entries are stored locally on the user's device. These entries are not transmitted to the developer or to the Orthodox West website, and the developer cannot access their contents.

Users are responsible for maintaining the security of their device and the information stored within the confession journal.

## Fasting and Feast-Day Calendar

WR Prayer Book provides a fasting and feast-day calendar using publicly available information retrieved from the Orthodox West website. The app accesses publicly available pages on Orthodox West to obtain calendar information. ([https://www.orthodoxwest.com/](https://www.orthodoxwest.com/))

## Analytics, Advertising, and Tracking

WR Prayer Book does not use confession journal information for analytics, advertising, tracking, or profiling.

WR Prayer Book does not sell users' personal information.

## Third-Party Services

The fasting and feast-day calendar uses information provided by Orthodox West. Users should refer to Orthodox West's privacy practices for information regarding its website and services.

WR Prayer Book may also rely on services provided by Apple as part of the normal operation and distribution of an iOS application.

## Children's Privacy

WR Prayer Book does not knowingly collect personal information from children or other users.

## Changes to This Privacy Policy

This Privacy Policy may be updated if the features or data practices of WR Prayer Book change. Updates will be published on this page with a revised "Last Updated" date.

## Contact

Questions about this Privacy Policy or WR Prayer Book may be directed to the developer using the contact information provided on the WR Prayer Book support page.
